R3.2	NOT_VERIFIABLE — a defined behaviour for every opportunity type on every class is the sum of the other criteria and the UC vectors; no single test decides it
R11.2	NOT_VERIFIABLE — a property of the architecture: the Player reads only the APS's resolution document, so no test can present it with an ADS format to fail on
R21.1	NOT_VERIFIABLE — a permission (MAY release resources): every behaviour conforms, so nothing can fail
R29.10	NOT_VERIFIABLE — whether a declared capability is the device's real one is a property of the device; the harness emulates classes by profile (ADR 0080) and has no real device to compare against
R33.2	NOT_VERIFIABLE — binds only a Player that reports metrics, which is optional (DP-4), and the specification defines no channel a test could read the report from
R37.1	NOT_VERIFIABLE — a permission (MAY implement a pause by any mechanism): every mechanism conforms, so nothing can fail; where the pause resumes is R37.2's
R41.4	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: the option-level declaration of the ad's audio (R41.3) is not placed in the specification (Not placed row 4), so no option's audio can be heard
R41.5	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: the window-level audio allowance (R41.2) and the option-level audio declaration are not placed (Not placed row 4)
R41.6	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: no option can declare its audio (R41.3, Not placed row 4)
R41.7	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: the second audio source the criterion bounds is an option that declares its audio (R41.3), which is not placed (Not placed row 4)
R42.3	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: the occurrence-beacon carrier of R42.1 is not placed (Not placed row 8)
R44.3	NOT_VERIFIABLE — running a verification SDK is optional, and the verification resources it would be handed have no carrier (R44.1, Not placed row 9)
R47.2	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: viewability beacons ride the occurrence carrier of R42.1, not placed (Not placed rows 8 and 10)
R48.3	NOT_VERIFIABLE — no carrier: the per-candidate disclosure carrier of R48.1 is not placed (Not placed row 11)
